ms\nConcierge e experiências exclusivas\nMenu de serviços essenciais e à la carte\nVagas para visitantes\n\nUma proposta de moradia que vai além do espaço físico, integrando conforto, tempo e qualidade de vida.\nSeu bem-estar em 360°.\n\nEntre em contato para negociarmos este lugar incrível,  ideal para viver em Curitiba.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0ad06d9c-228f-47c8-a487-287e6c7b22a6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/76806836-e1e0-426c-91e2-110aefdae339.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2ba90f64-8790-4c57-885a-e26d96da499a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/487ea8d3-6d72-4563-ad17-f9cbd1e03a58.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b92e4b99-b74e-4aae-b058-13ab890d67c3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9652f8a4-0828-4043-8fa5-701769d2207b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9dc3abca-a2da-4814-acd7-bf036d90c10b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0e0a5595-7763-446b-8c51-caf421332033.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/037a74ae-0472-4d6f-a5d4-b38b1c912f94.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a527f01b-a389-475c-af37-a9cc809f45bd.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/683b2341145c452b0c32bcb2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/48970f8e-00bc-40af-8820-ab2817213759.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-